# Mobile release binaries. The APK is a Flutter build output, not source: the
# mobile-build workflow publishes it as a GitHub Actions artifact. Committing it
# put a 64MB file under public/, where Vite copies it into .output/public and
# blew the 15MB client bundle budget in CI.
public/downloads/
*.apk
public/*.apk

